# IMPORTANT: Run this collection only with the disposable profile setup in README.md.
# The mutation requests persist changes to the EdgeProxy config selected by the running process.

@gateway = http://127.0.0.1:8081
@admin = http://127.0.0.1:9191
@adminToken = dev-security-token
@route = demo-app

### 1. Inspect the initial Origin set - expected origin-1 only
GET {{admin}}/api/v1/edgeproxy/routes/{{route}}/origins
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Add the second local Origin to the disposable EdgeProxy profile
POST {{admin}}/api/v1/edgeproxy/routes/{{route}}/origins
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "http://127.0.0.1:9001",
  "insecure_skip_verify": false,
  "name": "origin-2",
  "weight": 1,
  "priority": 2
}

### 3. Select round-robin scheduling
PUT {{admin}}/api/v1/edgeproxy/routes/{{route}}/load-balancing
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "algorithm": "round_robin",
  "latency_sensitivity": 1,
  "ewma_alpha": 0.25
}

### 3b. Readiness gate - re-run until both Origins report healthy
GET {{admin}}/api/v1/edgeproxy/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4a. Uncached scheduler sample - inspect JSON origin
GET {{gateway}}/api/time

### 4b. Repeat - expected other healthy Origin under round robin
GET {{gateway}}/api/time

### 4c. Repeat again to make the sequence obvious
GET {{gateway}}/api/time

### 4d. Repeat again
GET {{gateway}}/api/time

### 5. Switch to priority failover: priority 1 is preferred while healthy
PUT {{admin}}/api/v1/edgeproxy/routes/{{route}}/load-balancing
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "algorithm": "priority_failover",
  "latency_sensitivity": 1,
  "ewma_alpha": 0.25
}

### 6. With both healthy, expected JSON origin="origin-1"
GET {{gateway}}/api/time

### 7. After stopping origin-1 and waiting for health detection, expected origin-2
GET {{gateway}}/api/time

### 8. Inspect scheduler and Origin readiness through the management boundary
GET {{admin}}/api/v1/edgeproxy/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. OPTIONAL CLEANUP - restore round robin
PUT {{admin}}/api/v1/edgeproxy/routes/{{route}}/load-balancing
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "algorithm": "round_robin",
  "latency_sensitivity": 1,
  "ewma_alpha": 0.25
}

### 10. OPTIONAL CLEANUP - remove origin-2 from the disposable profile
DELETE {{admin}}/api/v1/edgeproxy/routes/{{route}}/origins/origin-2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
